  "full_response": "Certainly! Below is a draft of a reference letter. Please replace the placeholders with the actual details as needed:\n\n---\n\n[Your Name]  \n[Your Position]  \n[Your Company/Organization]  \n[Your Address]  \n[City, State, ZIP Code]  \n[Your Email Address]  \n[Your Phone Number]  \n\n[Date]  \n\n[Recipient's Name]  \n[Recipient's Position]  \n[Recipient's Company/Organization]  \n[Recipient's Address]  \n[City, State, ZIP Code]  \n\nDear [Recipient's Name],  \n\nI am writing to wholeheartedly recommend [Applicant's Full Name] for the position at [Position/Program Name]. As [Applicant's Position] at [Current Employer], I have had the pleasure of working closely with [Applicant's Full Name] for [duration, e.g., the past two years]. Throughout their tenure, [he/she/they] has demonstrated exceptional skills, work ethic, and professionalism that make [him/her/them] an outstanding candidate.\n\n[Applicant's Full Name] has consistently exceeded expectations in their role as [Specific Role or Project at Current Employer]. [His/Her/Their] expertise in [relevant skillset or industry] is evident in the successful completion of [specific project or achievement]. Moreover, [he/she/they] possesses excellent communication and leadership abilities, often taking the initiative to lead team projects and mentor new employees.\n\nBeyond [his/her/their] technical skills, [Applicant's Full Name] is known for [positive personal trait or interpersonal skill], contributing to a collaborative and positive work environment. [He/She/They] handles pressure gracefully and adapts to new challenges with poise and confidence. This balance of skills and character has consistently delivered results that positively impact our organization.\n\nShould you require further information, please feel free to contact me at [Your Email Address] or [Your Phone Number].  \n\nThank you for considering my recommendation. I am confident that [Applicant's Full Name] will be a great asset to your team.\n\nSincerely,  \n\n[Your Signature (for hard copy)]  \n\n[Your Typed Name]  \n[Your Position]  \n[Your Contact Information]  \n\n---\n\nPlease replace placeholders with the actual information. Let me know if you need any further assistance!",
